<title>USA: MBIA qualifies 20 muni bond issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies 20 muni bond issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said on Tuesday that it qualified for bond insurance the following 20 municipal bond issues scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Downey, U.S.D., Calif., General Obligations (GOs), $7 million.</p>
<p>--Connecticut Resource Recovery $8 million system bonds.</p>
<p>--Rockford Park Dt., Ill., GOs, $5.05 million.</p>
<p>--Danville, Ky., $9 million lease revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Dearborn Heights, Mich., Wastewater Disposal Facilities, $4.88 million.</p>
<p>--St Michael, Minn., GOs Improvement, $2.365 million.</p>
<p>--Catawba County, N.C., GOs School, $14.6 million.</p>
<p>--Essex Fells Bor Board of Education, N.J., School District, $2.631 million.</p>
<p>--Freehold Township Board of Education, N.J., School, $26.9 million.</p>
<p>--Albuquerque Tech Vocational, N.M. GOs, $4 million.</p>
<p>--Belen Cons S.D. #2, N.M., GOs, $3.2 million.</p>
<p>--Briarcliff Manor C.S.D., N.Y., School District, $4.575 million.</p>
<p>--East Greenbush CSD, N.Y., $2.05 million school district bonds.</p>
<p>--Huntington, N.Y., Public Improvement, $6.665 million.</p>
<p>--Brookland Cayce S.D. #2, S.C., GOs, $10 million.</p>
<p>--Cleveland, Tenn., Water Revenues, $9.75 million.</p>
<p>--Del Rio, Texas, Certificates of Obligation, $2 million.</p>
<p>--Harris County, M.U.D. #151, Texas, Tax, $4.65 million.</p>
<p>--Fitchburg, Wis., GO Prom, $4.735 million.</p>
<p>--Fitchburg, Wis., GO Muni Building, $3.25 million.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
